# The sorted profile codes of the A15 centroid enumeration

The 2212 base-141 codes of the canonical A15 centroid profiles, in
increasing order.  This list is the meeting point of the two halves of
`A15CentroidEnumerationInput`: `SRG266.Certificates.A15ListedProfileCodes`
checks it against the profiles that carry separators or survivor records, and
`SRG266.Certificates.A15EnumeratedProfileCodes` checks it against the output of
the magnitude search.  Neither check trusts this file -- both are `decide
+kernel` evaluations, and the sort is only ever used through the fact that it
permutes its input.
